WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:02.520
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:31.320
<i>And that concludes the battle</i>
<i>records we have on the Vital Guarder...</i>

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.530
<i>...that took place in Mars' satellite orbit.</i>

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:38.020
<i>As you saw, after numerous fights against</i>
<i>this mysterious enemy fleet, we finally...!</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.230
<i>Finally!</i>

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.760
<i>We finally were able to grasp victory!</i>

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.870
<i>We won!!</i>

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:50.580
We won!!

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.110
<i>We won!!</i>

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.420
We won!!

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:59.850
We won! We won! We won! We won...!

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.220
What good will increasing everyone's
fighting spirit do?

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:06.190
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:13.770
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:17.770
Although loneliness...

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:22.110
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:29.350
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:34.420
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.390
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:44.920
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:48.700
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:52.330
...that you saw cross paths

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:56.030
Some light is shed...

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:00.620
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:07.850
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:15.860
The things I want have no shape

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:24.270
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:38.320
After the Party

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.070
Hi.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.510
A party?

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:10.310
Only until the authorities on Mars
respond to our rescue signals.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.320
All that's left to do is wait anyway, and
everyone has been under so much pressure.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.860
And, it would be an opportunity
to get rid of the suspicion...

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:20.760
...that people have
against the bridge crew.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:24.650
What do you think?

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.460
Why bother?

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:30.370
There are no adults here,
and no society to protect.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:33.530
You are under no obligation to take on
troublesome matters for the sake of others.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.140
Am I wrong?

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.940
You may be right, but I don't
like this rigid atmosphere.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:40.300
Do as you wish.

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.980
Party? Why, sure.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.410
We can help by preparing the food, right?

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.650
I'm counting on you.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.660
Sure, we'll help.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.130
As long as it won't get in
the way of our bridge duties.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.650
Thanks.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.160
I don't wanna help out.
But I'll be the MC, if you want.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.530
Th-Thanks.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.970
I am busy with a bunch of things,
but I'm sure I can find time to help.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:06.900
A-Appreciate it.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:10.370
Anyone who wants to perform at the event
can make a request through their terminal.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:13.810
If you need material or food,
submit an application for it.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:18.140
We'll be informing you by terminal
where the event will take place.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.680
We're looking for volunteers
to help the event committee.

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:22.480
We need your help.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.480
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.730
This is a breakdown of duties for event
committee members, and a schedule.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:29.860
Thank you.

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:31.260
Wow. Very detailed.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.830
I commit 100 percent to anything I do,
no matter how trivial the job may be.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.610
Boss. Aren't you afraid coming
out here dressed like that?

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.150
We're protected by a field
covering the ship's body.

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:52.320
Stop wasting your time worrying
about me, and get to work!

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.350
Why don't you help me, Boss?

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.320
Kick!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.160
Hey, hey, hey, hey! Outta my way!

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.060
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.170
I brought the stuff!

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.260
Thank you, Nicks.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.770
I think we have most
of the materials now.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:12.710
Next, we'll build the tower...!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:16.780
How shall we do it?
I'm not too great with these things.

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.400
You're missing the point...!

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.440
Hey, do you know what happened to Gran?

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.120
I hear he's isolated in a special room.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:25.480
Special purpose room?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.560
<i>This is a message to all</i>
<i>members of the event committee.</i>

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.460
- <i>A number of supplies have been taken...</i>
- I didn't think he'd be that kind of guy.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:33.450
<i>...to the loading entrance of block 52.</i>
- This voice. Faina?

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.960
<i>All those available,</i>
<i>please help with the move.</i>

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:38.300
- All right. I'll be right there.
- One, two. One, two.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.400
One, two. One, two.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.960
Move those things like
you were instructed, okay?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.060
We know!

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.940
Group 8, start programming the robot.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:51.980
Yes. Kouji here.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:55.150
- Is 7 enough colors for the light effects?
- We can't finish the haunted house.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:57.050
I've brought the materials.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.920
I got the sewing machine.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.410
Hey, you're not doing it here, are you?

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:02.990
We have no choice. There's no time.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.430
I'll do all the measuring and cutting.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:08.590
Then why don't we go
over and help out Kouji?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.660
Isn't the food ready yet?

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:13.000
We're all starving here!
Will you hurry up?

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.460
Okay! Right away!

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.030
Why should I be in charge
of preparing meals?

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:22.610
Isn't Heiger thankful at all for
the chance my father gave him...?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.800
Preparing meals is a very important job!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.080
It sure is! Hands off!

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:30.550
Man... If Juli hadn't asked,
I would never do this job.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:31.710
Sorry, Lucson!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:35.150
Um, ah, he's a well-behaved child.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.990
Pull! Pull! Pull!

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:43.090
The party area is starting to take shape.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.730
But I'm not capable of
working on the final touches.

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.300
A friend of mine with the ground crew...

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.640
...his name Radan, is perfect
for this sort of stuff.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.740
However, he said he wasn't interested.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:54.300
Is that so.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.510
That's too bad.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.840
Have you decided what
to wear to the party?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.310
First I wanna decide
who my partner will be.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:02.850
Right. You have a point.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:05.150
Come on, let's do something ourselves.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.990
But I haven't been able to find
all the parts to my costume.

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.760
Hey, if it isn't Kouji's little brother.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:21.900
Where's the friend you're always with?

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.470
What do you mean?

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.770
I'm talking about Son.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:27.870
Oh, him. He's in the
most appropriate place.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:30.540
He has the choice of either going nuts,
or severing his lifeline.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.140
How could you say such a
thing with a cool expression?

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.750
One of those two is your friend.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.450
That traitor!

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.580
He's no friend of mine.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.550
Boss.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.590
That was cruel to suddenly
kick me like that.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.220
If I didn't have this lifeline and spacesuit,
I would've been a goner.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.390
Boss. Can I ask you a question?

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:51.160
What is it?

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.790
What have you been doing?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.140
I'm letting my mantle trail behind me...
outside of the spaceship!

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:56.900
Why?

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.430
This is how I live my life!

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:05.370
I've been wondering,
what's this wire for?

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:06.740
I wonder.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.320
- A ghost!
- A ghost!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.490
Hey, I've got a great idea.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.220
What is it, Emer.

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.030
A beauty contest.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.070
What's that?

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.000
You see...

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:31.270
...we'll have a beauty contest at the party
to confirm that you're the most beautiful!

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:34.210
Then we would be the number
one couple on Ryvius!

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:36.000
Really?
Okay, let's do it.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.640
Every section's falling behind schedule.
This isn't good.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.520
<i>Are you there, Kouji?</i>

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.920
<i>A suggestion's been made</i>
<i>for an interesting feature.</i>

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:46.720
What is it?

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:48.390
<i>A beauty contest!</i>

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:51.260
<i>I'm not an expert on these things,</i>
<i>but I think it would liven up the party.</i>

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.690
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.130
I also think it'll do well.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.500
<i>Okay, then it's decided!</i>

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.400
<i>I'm sure we can count on Heiger</i>
<i>for a detailed schedule on it!</i>

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.870
<i>Bye! Be sure to submit her as a candidate!</i>

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:04.970
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.600
<i>I prefer to stay away</i>
<i>from such showy events.</i>

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.570
<i>I had a hunch you'd say that.</i>

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.800
<i>I can help with the announcements.</i>

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:14.510
<i>Please.</i>

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:16.510
It's not gonna happen.

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.710
Where would I find Kouji Aiba?

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.950
You're talking to him.

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:26.180
Could you please allow us
to help with the party?

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:27.430
Please.

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:29.830
No problem. And who are you?

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:30.800
Radan.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.060
And his follower.

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:34.400
Oh, so you're...!
By all means.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:37.100
We could use you as one
of our core staff members.

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:42.570
As a condition, we'd like to be
taken off our post to work outside.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.340
W-Well, I'm not authorized, but I'll talk
to those in charge and see what I can do.

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.150
What a relief!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:55.190
And so, our party was
beginning to take shape.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.380
Before I knew it, everyone was united,
determined to make the party a success.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.500
I believed the party would be
a fun event to let us forget...

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.560
...the events we'd encountered
from that day on.

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.170
Ow!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.160
That's not your section!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.910
Come on, a little isn't
gonna make a difference!

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:16.040
Stop it, you two!

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.100
Shut up, you!

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.350
Asking for a fight?

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:22.270
Attacks, betrayal, destruction...

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:25.350
...these all add fuel to an
obscure anxiety in everyone.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.350
Everyone's feeling it.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.150
The sense that maybe we're
in for more hardship.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.160
Although we haven't been
mistaken to this point.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.390
No, we're not mistaken.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:41.840
You must be going through hell.

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.030
Both of us.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.140
We're now done with all preparations.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:48.110
Sorry to have to rely on you
to help me with all this.

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:52.940
Don't apologize. You know,
I'm grateful that you're around.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:55.310
Hey, don't get smoochy with me.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.380
I'm serious.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.410
You're all right.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.190
What do they want now?

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:07.060
I pity you.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.860
If you're grateful that I'm around,
come with me.

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:09.760
No.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.500
Kouji.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.470
Yeah?

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.000
Let's make it a success.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:17.640
Yeah.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.130
We made an awful lot.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:23.270
Do you still have to work?

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.470
Final checks of the party hall!

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.750
But I made all this food for us.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.640
Sorry, I'll have it later.
I've gotta hurry.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:37.080
Kouji's really into this, almost <i>too</i> much.
He's like a different person.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.930
<i>What's he so worried about?</i>

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.420
Ikumi! How about something to eat?

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:45.290
Hey! It's gonna get cold!

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:53.430
What is it?

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:58.910
I'm sorry.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.640
It's all right. It's all right.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:31.930
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:36.980
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:43.480
Please present your ID card at the entrance.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.830
We're not getting any
electricity here. Hurry, hurry!

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.020
Okay, okay!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:50.320
Aoi! Can you help with food preparations?
They're falling behind.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.030
Wait a moment.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:56.430
Come on. You think I'll do anything
you want just because we're friends.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.170
You're the only one I can count on.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.410
Actually, I don't mind.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:00.770
Shall I help?

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:01.610
Thanks.

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.770
I made this especially for you, and now
you say you're not going to the party?

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.810
Of course not. It's a waste of time.

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:10.650
What is it all of a sudden?
This wasn't easy to make, you know!

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.790
- You're being ridiculous.
- Pat. Are you ready for the party?

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:13.780
Is this okay?

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.190
It'll have to do. It's all you have, right?

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:15.860
I'm going.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:16.520
Huh?

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.460
I'm going.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.360
Aren't you attending?

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:29.370
I'm not in the mood.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.880
Look at the monitor. There must have
been enough damage done to Mars...

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:38.280
...in the battle involving Vital
Guarder to affect Mars' axis.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.870
Blue. You're an intelligent person.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.370
You must've figured this kind of
thing would happen. And still...!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:01.190
You must have known who the
enemy was that attacked us.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.260
Wear this and attend the party.

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:03.970
But I...!

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:04.940
That's an order.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.740
You're very forceful.

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.950
We'll start in five minutes!

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.750
Okay. Let's do it!

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:23.590
<i>Ladies and gentlemen!</i>

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.060
<i>Welcome to the party!</i>

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:33.930
Good!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.700
<i>I'm glad to see you all</i>
<i>made it to the Ryvius Party!</i>

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:40.670
<i>I'm Fu Namuchai, your master of</i>
<i>ceremonies for today's event.</i>

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:45.200
<i>This party is being</i>
<i>sponsored by us supervisors.</i>

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.100
Sponsored by the supervisors?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:48.910
Figures.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.620
No. Fu's just saying so on his own.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.980
Looks like he's taken advantage of us.

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:57.520
Don't let that bother you.
Zwei's already hated as it is.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:00.460
<i>Now, I leave you all to enjoy yourselves.</i>

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.900
I made this.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.000
I already have enough.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.600
Well, have more!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:09.100
Baking all these sweets,
no wonder your body fat...!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.540
I... take... that... back.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.840
Hey! Don't pick it up with your hand!

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:13.910
S-Sorry.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.610
Don't put it back!

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:18.740
Listen, Pat. I told you about
manners during events like these.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.540
A gentleman must be particularly
aware of his manners...!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.650
Hey! You're being rude to
this lady you don't even know.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:27.480
I'm terribly sorry. He's only a child.

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:28.950
What are you saying, Lucson?

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.690
Could you possibly be... Juli?

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:35.960
Yes.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.830
<i>Now everybody. It's the moment</i>
<i>you've been waiting for.</i>

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.170
<i>We will now begin our Beauty Contest.</i>

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.900
- <i>We're still accepting candidates...!</i>

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.570
- <i>We're still accepting candidates...!</i>
- I wish that girl would participate.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:44.870
Who are you talking about?

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.170
I saw her in the Lift-ship
while we were battling.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:50.940
She wore a metallic purple outfit,
and was really cute!

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:51.470
Really?

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.540
Sorry you're stuck with bridge duties.

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:04.850
My friend made this.
I can't guarantee the taste.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.760
You're unusual.

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.760
Faina! It's you, Faina!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.260
Long time no see!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:15.760
Sandy...

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:20.970
It was then that I noticed a mist form
around me in the clear outer space.

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:24.140
The atmosphere was that of a spooky tale...

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:28.150
It's just a coincidence that
I ended up at the bridge.

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.710
Oh, by the way what's up with McBain?
Aren't you together?

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:34.220
How do you know about that?

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.720
I should know.
I used to be your roommate.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:40.660
Which reminds me, he was saying he had
something important to talk to you about.

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:43.330
- <i>Entry number 5, Lilith Frau.</i>
- Emer!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.800
Next person, please.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.330
This is delicious.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:47.400
Is it?

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.440
Juli, can I see you?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.370
Is there a problem?

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.570
Ah, well... Won't you be a candidate
for the... beauty contest?

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:55.740
Me?

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.000
Someone anonymously entered your name.

00:16:58.610 --> 00:16:59.610
I wonder who?

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.170
You're already entered to appear.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:02.500
You're kidding.

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:06.110
<i>Entry number 7, Enima Lugisky.</i>

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:08.120
Sh-She's pretty cute.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.420
<i>And now, our next entry!</i>

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.730
Eins! Have you seen Faina?

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.790
Huh? Wait a moment.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.670
She's not inside.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:21.190
Oh...!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:23.440
Thanks.

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:28.610
You...!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:30.410
Wait!

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:31.830
Don't go!

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.650
<i>Entry number 12, Juli Bahana!</i>

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:44.180
She's gorgeous.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.760
<i>And there you have it,</i>
<i>the entrants for the beauty contest.</i>

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:49.690
<i>You can vote at the end of the party.</i>
<i>Please set up the terminals.</i>

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:55.230
<i>Next we will begin our Vital Guarder</i>
<i>Control Robot Gesture Contest!</i>

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:57.740
- <i>Your programming will move the robot!</i>
- That program was a tough one to create.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:01.510
- <i>It has been programmed for beginners...</i>
- Maybe I'll try. Ikumi! You can help!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.940
<i>...so anyone can enjoy this contest!</i>
- Kozue! Don't stop with Ikumi! Help!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:09.550
Kouji, you were the one who said
not to change the Ryvius' course?

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:10.180
Yeah.

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.580
You're not thinking
things through, you fool.

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.580
<i>Now for our next question.</i>

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:19.060
Hey Yuki. What are you doing here?

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.620
If you don't wanna be with me,
you should go somewhere else.

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:27.200
I'd hate to miss the chance to see that
troubled look on your face, Kouji.

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:28.530
What?

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:30.300
Is that your reason?

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.100
Now it's your turn to answer my question!

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:36.640
Faina S. Shinozaki.
Do you plan to go steady with her?

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:38.310
What's wrong with that?

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:39.850
Everything. It's disgraceful.

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:41.610
Be more specific! Why is it wrong?

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:42.920
I don't wanna tell you!

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:44.180
Why not?

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.580
I've had enough of your selfishness!
What's wrong with you?!

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:49.150
What don't you like about Faina?

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.200
Great tune, don't you think?

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:05.100
I selected it. You're Yuki Aiba, right?

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:07.630
The top operator of Vital Guarder.
You're quite a hero around here.

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:09.240
You making fun of me?

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:11.950
Not at all. I'm interested in you.

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:13.410
I'm not in the mood.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.350
Do you know her?

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:17.850
The girl in the pink outfit?

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.610
I haven't seen her name on any list.

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:23.010
No one in their right mind would
have a photo ID made in that outfit.

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.020
I guess not.

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:26.750
Yuki...!

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:28.990
Faina!

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.800
I was looking for you.

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.290
Kouji.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:35.320
U-Um...

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.370
Let's go to the party.

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:39.900
I'm not in the mood.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.100
Oh, sorry. But...

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.440
Well...!

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.410
You're afraid of being hurt, aren't you?

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:48.600
That's why you try to be kind to everyone.

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:51.520
Because you want everyone
to be nice to you.

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:52.920
But remember this.

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:57.210
If you keep up your defenses you
can hurt the feelings of others.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.800
Chic here. Where are you, Kouji? Kouji!

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.030
Hey!!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.640
Let's go.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.740
I want to go with you.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:20.970
Sure.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.950
The guy's not doing his job.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.990
So those two are a couple, after all.

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:36.530
Starting off with a slow dance?

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:38.250
I'm impressed. I'm impressed.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.330
<i>Kouji.</i>

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.040
That bastard.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.270
<i>Now, everyone.</i>

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:55.350
<i>It's time to determine the</i>
<i>winner of the beauty contest!</i>

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:59.950
<i>Please enter the contestant number and</i>
<i>we will announce the number one beauty!</i>

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.520
<i>Everyone, cast your vote...</i>

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:05.580
<i>Now!</i>

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:08.950
<i>Everybody, press those buttons!</i>

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:14.720
<i>Now, who will be crowned the</i>
<i>number one beauty aboard the Ryvius?</i>

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:19.570
<i>I will repeat the official</i>
<i>statement released by the alliance.</i>

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:23.040
<i>It has been confirmed that the mysterious</i>
<i>spaceship that caused damage</i> to...

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:27.110
<i>...a submersible ship, scout boats and</i>
<i>Fleets Two and Six of the Mars Forces...</i>

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:33.250
<i>...is a ship under top secret development</i>
<i>that sank into Geduld one month ago.</i>

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:36.990
<i>According to a criminal declaration</i>
<i>of a crewmember, the ship is "Ryvius".</i>

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:43.200
<i>They've acted in protest of Earth</i>
<i>taking control of the Solar System...</i>

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.100
<i>...and a message has been received</i>
<i>that such action will continue.</i>

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:47.470
- <i>Alliance Chief Director has announced...</i>
- Mars Forces?

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:49.170
<i>...the terrorist's demands won't be met...</i>
- We've been framed.

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:50.200
<i>...and he has made it clear that...</i>
- <i>K- Kouji.</i>

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.440
<i>...and he has made it clear that...</i>
- They're calling us terrorists?

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:54.670
<i>...he is prepared for resistance to Ryvius.</i>
Why? For what reason?

00:21:54.670 --> 00:22:00.340
<i>People from the stations on Mars</i>
<i>have been ordered to take shelter...</i>

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:12.410
In your dry eyes...

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:17.480
...a silhouette appears

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:22.190
The blue colored future...

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:28.920
...swayed and glittered

00:22:30.100 --> 00:22:38.340
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:38.340 --> 00:22:46.950
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:55.390
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.290
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:59.290 --> 00:23:05.660
goodbye

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:11.320
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:12.560
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:14.530
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future
As Ryvius wanders about...

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:17.300
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future
...it is surrounded by a
swirl of conspiracies and machinations.

00:23:17.300 --> 00:23:18.830
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future
Not knowing anything...

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:21.470
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future
...we had no choice but
to open the box titled "despair".

00:23:21.470 --> 00:23:23.230
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future
But there is no light in that box.

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:26.200
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future
The whereabouts of the
future could not be found anywhere.

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:28.970
Next episode: Whereabouts of the Future
The word "hope" is nothing more
than remnants of a dream.
